ne-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606222327267029_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606222327267029_720.jpg"> </div><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230735337498_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230735337498_1280.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230735337498_1280.jpg"> </div><p>【世界杯战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/match1869194date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">提前出线！阿根廷2-0奥地利 梅西失点+双响18球独享世界杯射手王</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260623/zhanbao_image_1869194_1782156934_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260623/zhanbao_image_1869194_1782156934_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260623/zhanbao_image_1869194_1782156934_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>阿根廷2-0奥地利提前一轮小组出线，阿根廷最后一轮对阵约旦，奥地利最后一轮对阵阿尔及利亚。</p><p>【梅西独占世界杯射手王】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a3940b5449a9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">见证历史！梅西28场世界杯18球，超越克洛泽独享世界杯历史射手王</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398b0a9b7bc.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398b0a9b7bc.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398b0a9b7bc.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷对阵奥地利。比赛中梅西打入个人世界杯生涯第18球，正式超越德国名宿克洛泽，成为世界杯历史第一射手。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a398ecae5c98native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西独享世界杯历史射手王！FIFA官方贺图：6届世界杯28场18球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230336508491_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230336508491_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230336508491_720.jpg"> </div><p>梅西打进一球，以17球独享世界杯历史射手王。FIFA官方也制作贺图向梅西送上祝贺。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a398bd08e6f4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">直播吧海报|球王独尊-梅西18球超越传奇，独自为王！来点赞看特效</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398b0607525.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398b0607525.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398b0607525.jpg"> </div><p>梅西世界杯18球，刷新纪录，独占射手王宝座。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a3984c3e999enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">连场最佳！官方：梅西当选阿根廷2-0奥地利全场最佳球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230333514096.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230333514096.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230333514096.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷2-0奥地利。本场比赛梅西双响，个人世界杯进球数到18球，独享世界杯射手王！梅西当选本场比赛全场最佳球员！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a3985a57a00anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">纪录之夜！梅西一战刷新九大纪录：世界杯历史射手王、胜场王…</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398b0607525.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398b0607525.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398b0607525.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷2-0战胜奥地利，两连胜提前一轮小组出线。本场比赛梅西梅开二度，一战刷新九大纪录，包括世界杯历史射手王等。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a398c3f31705native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西：罚丢点球之后确实有段时间非常生气懊恼，但后来我弥补了它</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a398a9534674native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西：本届所有比赛都势均力敌 我享受这一刻渴望和队友一起庆祝</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a398f08a8e39native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">燃尽了！梅西：我很累，筋疲力尽、很难去思考，享受这一时刻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398d858c578_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398d858c578.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a398d858c578.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯J组第二轮，阿根廷2-0奥地利。赛后梅西接受多家媒体采访。</p><p>【世界杯相关】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a39b263a9a56native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">推迟近1小时！官方：因雷暴影响，7点前法国vs伊拉克比赛不会恢复</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a39b4226ce2c_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a39b4226ce2c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a39b4226ce2c.jpg"> </div><p>国际足联确认，由于恶劣天气影响，法国vs伊拉克的下半场，预计在北京时间7点之前都不会开球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a395a000c664native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">本届第4支！阿根廷提前一轮出线，连续6届晋级世界杯淘汰赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a39832115012.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a39832115012.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a39832115012.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷2-0战胜奥地利，以两连胜战绩提前一轮锁定淘汰赛席位。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a399be8de23fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">埃杜：罗梅罗之前受伤的膝盖不适，不会出战末轮但有望赶上淘汰赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.67" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a399c7f7c759.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a399c7f7c759.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a399c7f7c759.jpg"> </div><p>埃杜发文表示，罗梅罗膝盖受伤，无缘小组赛末轮，但有望赶上淘汰赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a398fc4b0634native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">纪录被破！克洛泽祝贺梅西：对我来说梅西是GOAT，恭喜你，冠军！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230343473821.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230343473821.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230343473821.jpg"> </div><p>梅西双响打入个人世界杯第18球，超过克洛泽的16球，独享世界杯射手王。克洛泽祝贺并致敬梅西。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a39a24915b8cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">公开要求转会！小蜘蛛：转会对所有人来说都是最好，我想实现梦想</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230740584060.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230740584060.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230740584060.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯J组第二轮，阿根廷2-0奥地利。赛后，阿尔瓦雷斯接受采访，公开转会意向，要求离开马竞。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a39b751ad258native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞回应小蜘蛛转会宣言：早见过巴萨的手段，这次不会让他们得逞</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230741007633.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230741007633_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/202606230741007633_720.jpg"> </div><p>马竞通过阿斯报发布声明，就阿尔瓦雷斯称希望转会的言论进行回应。此前阿尔瓦雷斯称希望实现梦想，转会对各方都最好。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a39aa271f10cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴萨跟队：阿尔瓦雷斯拒绝了皇马和阿森纳 马竞被迫和巴萨谈判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a39aad7ef157_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a39aad7ef157.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260623/6a39aad7ef157.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨跟队记者Javi Miguel报道称，阿尔瓦雷斯已经拒绝了去皇马或阿森纳，马竞别无选择必须和巴萨谈判。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-23/6a399b42430bcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">不退役！官方：41岁蒂亚戈·席尔瓦以自由身再次回归弗鲁米嫩塞</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.82" dat